OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FOne or two showers possible
OL,6,Ftoday across Devon and Cornwall,
OL,7,Fotherwise another dry day with plenty
OL,8,Fof sunshine. A brisk westerly wind
OL,9,Fdeveloping which will help make it
OL,10,Ffeel a little fresher, but still
OL,11,Ffeeling warm in the strong sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA few showers continuing
OL,14,Fovernight, especially in the west of
OL,15,Fthe region. The breeze also gradually
OL,16,Feasing overnight, with the clearest
OL,17,Fskies towards the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
