OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAnother largely dry day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunshine, although a few
OL,7,Fshowers may continue throughout the
OL,8,Fmorning towards Devon and Cornwall.
OL,9,FTemperatures around average.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,12,Fdry and bright on Friday and Saturday
OL,13,Fwith temperatures also increasing. A
OL,14,Frisk of some showers on Sunday but
OL,15,Fstaying dry and warm for most.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
